  "start_date_to": "1109-12-31",
  "start_date_from": "1092-01-01",
  "start_date_sort": "1100-12-31",
  "comments": "Epistle of instruction regarding the resolve to attain Buddhahood in 28 verses (according to \u015a\u0101kya mchog ldan\u2019s division) of 2, 4 and 6 lines, of 7 syllables (17\u201327) and 11 syllables (1\u201316, 28). It was composed for the community of Ru gsum in gTsong kha (ID:5631).\r\nKano considers the \"sPring yig bdud rtsi'i phreng ba\" mentioned in an early unpublished biography of 'Phags pa Blo gros rgyal mtshan by rDo rje 'dzin pa Ye shes rgyal mtshan as a part of the teachings transmitted to 'Phags pa by Nyi ma (ID:4136) (see [A62SS59H]: xiii and [BAQ9MH4T]: 207, n. 76) to be identical to this work.",
  "alternative_names": "rngog blo ldan shes rab kyis mdzad pa'i springs yig bdud rtsi'i thig pa\r\nsprings yig bdud rtsi'i thig pa\r\nspring yig bdud rtsi'i thigs pa\r\nspring pa'i yi ge bdud rtsi thig le\r\nsprings pa'i yi ge bdud rtsi'i thig le\r\nspring yig bdud rtsi'i thigs pa\r\nle kha a mr\u00ef ta ti la ka nA ma kArika\r\nspring yig bdud rtsi'i phreng ba\r\nrngog  lo chen po blo ldan shes rab kyi springs yig bdud rtsi'i thig le\r\nle kha a mr\u00ef ta ti la ka nA ma kA ri ka",
